## Common Workflows

### Creating Database Migrations
```bash
# 1. Generate an autodetected migration revision
make migration-create MSG="add_feature_table"

# 2. Apply migration into containerized database
make migrate
```

{% if include_frontend %}
### Syncing TypeScript Frontend SDK
```bash
# Export OpenAPI 3.1 schema & generate typed TypeScript client bindings
make frontend-sync
```
{% endif %}

### Database Backups & Disaster Recovery
```bash
# Dump timestamped compressed PostgreSQL backup in backups/
make db-backup

# Verify backup archives
make db-backup-verify
```

{% if include_distributed_worker %}
### Distributed Background Worker
```bash
# Ensure background worker is active
make worker

# Tail live worker logs
make worker-logs
```
{% endif %}

{% if include_transactional_outbox %}
### Real-Time Event Outbox Relay
```bash
# Start the dedicated PostgreSQL LISTEN/NOTIFY outbox event daemon
make outbox-listen
```
{% endif %}

{% if include_go_telemetry %}
### Go High-Throughput Telemetry Ingest Bypass
```bash
# Build the compiled Go telemetry ingest microservice image
make build-telemetry

# Stream telemetry ingest service logs
make logs-telemetry
```
{% endif %}

{% if enable_quadlets %}
### Production Systemd Quadlet Validation
```bash
# Validate Quadlet service unit generation without altering host state
make quadlet-dryrun
```
{% endif %}

